e  hi jason well it's a very clear case  of suppression by the media and  it was actively first of all ignored  and then censored the new york post we  got the  hunter biden laptop we published our  first stories  on october 14 which was three weeks  before the election  ample time for there to be a proper  forensic  analysis of it all in the media and  unfortunately the very day that we  published  we had the other media ignoring it and  then we had big  tech censoring it twitter actually  closed down our account for two weeks  telling us that we had  broken their hat materials rules when  we hadn't at all and in fact they  admitted afterwards that no there was  nothing about  hacked material in what we did but you  saw  this evolution of the media first of all  ignoring the story  poo pooing it and then you had 50  former intelligence operatives such as  john brennan and james clapper  notorious for their pushing of the  russia collusion lie  they signed a letter saying that our  story and the laptop from hunter biden  that he had so recklessly  abandoned at a delaware mac repair shop  was russian disinformation they admitted  they'd never  actually looked at the laptop they  hadn't any evidence to say that it was  russian disinformation  but that's what they said and that was  the story that was run by  new york times and cnn and washington  post and all the rest of the  sort of establishment media that the  rest of the media looks to to set the  narrative  and it was only after the election when  hunter biden thought that it was safe  enough to come out  and issue a press release uh curiously  under the banner of his father's biden  harris  transition team uh admitting that hunter  was under federal  investigation what he called uh  so-called tax  issues and since then we've found that  there are as many as four  separate investigations in washington  and delaware into various  aspects of hunter biden's overseas  business dealings  including potential money laundering so  this is a big issue  it's not just pushed away and talking  about it as tax issues and it's not just  hunter biden it's actually about joe  biden  and joe biden's involvement in his  family's  influence peddling schemes overseas  whether it be ukraine  russia kazakhstan or most importantly  for america's national security  china what did joe biden know and how  intimately involved was he in that  business  we see quite a bit yeah and it's uh  it is telling that hunter biden has  something to say and then it comes out  on from the campaign letterhead that i  think that uh  is just another clue of how dep how in  depth and how wide this is  because i do think it involves the  entire family and as sean hannity said  it ain't going away miranda tammy thank  you so much for joining us tonight
 

